      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i'll try bumping the temp up to see if that helps the vibrancy. but the bleeding/blurring is still weird because even with consistent pressure it looks like the ink is just spreading out uncontrollably in some spots. like it's not even hitting the fabric where it should. do you think it could be an issue with the ink viscosity or something in the gas release? maybe a humidity problem?",
